<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges down to 4.6120 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges down to 4.6120 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.6120 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6115 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 30		  Oct 29</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6120		  4.6115</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    25,000		  100,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
